86432587 13194139534684 17592186045417 true] [17592186432596 1075 #edb/ref 17592186432589 13194139534684 17592186045417 true] [17592186432596 1075 #edb/ref 17592186432591 13194139534684 17592186045417 true] [17592186432596 1075 #edb/ref 17592186432592 13194139534684 17592186045417 true] [17592186432596 1075 #edb/ref 17592186432593 13194139534684 17592186045417 true] [17592186432596 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534684 17592186045417 true] [17592186432596 1077 "selection" 13194139534684 17592186045417 true] [17592186432596 1078 #edb/ref 17592186432591 13194139534684 17592186045417 true] [17592186432596 1079 #uuid "2881387b-754e-56f3-834a-ac7d858e2ecf" 13194139534684 17592186045417 true] [17592186432597 1068 #edb/ref 17592186432596 13194139534684 17592186045417 true] [17592186432597 1069 "q-138516" 13194139534684 17592186045417 true] [17592186432597 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534684 17592186045417 true] [17592186432597 1071 "$$\nU=[\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{aligned}],\\,Σ=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}],\\,V=[\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nConsider the matrices shown above. Given that $A=UΣ{V}^{T}$ is a singular value decomposition of $A,$ find the pseudoinverse ${A}^{+}.$" 13194139534684 17592186045417 true] [17592186432597 1072 #uuid "3fcee73d-521b-5fd0-a9c6-c7b6d8e05cce" 13194139534684 17592186045417 true] [17592186432597 1074 "If $A=UΣ{V}^{T}$ is a singular value decomposition of $A,$ then the pseudoinverse of $A$ is given by\n\n$$\nV\\,{Σ}^{+}\\,{U}^{T},\n$$\n\nwhere ${Σ}^{+}$ is the pseudoinverse of $Σ.$\n\nFirst, notice that\n\n$$\nV=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,{Σ}^{+}=\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}],\\,{U}^{T}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{+} & =V\\,{Σ}^{+}\\,{U}^{T} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534684 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"answer-065fffc8-3e59-5969-929b-5087533bf93f" 17592186432586 "answer-38c000fb-0f6e-5949-8db6-c4c5d28b3248" 17592186432587 "answer-39695dbd-9cb4-567f-a279-8277626c4d7e" 17592186432588 "answer-3fe77835-4c02-5a54-960e-f2c670d5fae4" 17592186432589 "answer-597aa326-f1e8-5701-9c20-5031aee7b048" 17592186432590 "answer-8e69fde6-984a-5a8b-8dd0-63b58423f006" 17592186432591 "answer-afeacb94-4e5b-58cc-be9f-c0b7884171f0" 17592186432592 "answer-c0338917-af25-5f02-ba7d-b2159df253f6" 17592186432593 "answer-fcd31e64-a634-576e-a8e8-c7e2bca6ed34" 17592186432594 "answer-ffb3d5ad-4c33-5033-8c68-0522a4f523a1" 17592186432595 "answer-field-2881387b-754e-56f3-834a-ac7d858e2ecf" 17592186432596 "question-3fcee73d-521b-5fd0-a9c6-c7b6d8e05cce" 17592186432597} :edb/committed false :edb/speculative true}
